  "pledge_heading": "Organization's Sacred Pledge",
  "pledge_subheading": "The solemn oath and guiding principles of Maratha Shivmudra Pratishthan",
  "pledge_p1": "I, remembering Almighty God, the revered deity of undivided Hindustan Shrimant Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj and our ancestors, pledge that,",
  "pledge_p2": "I shall make every effort to preserve the culture and civilization of the Dharma I was born into; and I shall consider it my foremost duty to work for the welfare of the society I grew up in.",
  "pledge_p3": "I pledge that I will imbibe the true, uncorrupted history of Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj & Chhatrapati Sambhaji Maharaj and always strive fearlessly to present it to the world.",
  "pledge_p4": "I swear that to accomplish the goals and objectives of the organization, I will strictly follow its rules, dedicate my body, mind, and wealth with honesty and selflessness throughout my life, and hold the organization's welfare supreme.",
  "pledge_slogans": "Jai Shri Ram ! Jai Shivray ! Jai Shambhuraje....Jayostu Maratha Shivmudra..",

